msgid "#PluralForms"
msgstr "nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);"

msgid "boxTooltip/description/text/bronze"
msgstr ""
"When opened, these boxes may grant you vehicles, in-game currencies, and "
"other valuable rewards."

msgid "boxTooltip/description/text/gold"
msgstr ""
"When opened, these boxes may grant you vehicles, in-game currencies, "
"customization elements, and other valuable rewards."

msgid "boxTooltip/description/text/silver"
msgstr ""
"When opened, these boxes may grant you vehicles, in-game currencies, "
"customization elements, and other valuable rewards."

msgid "boxTooltip/howGet/text/bronze"
msgstr ""
"Can be obtained from the in-game Store and received when opening boxes of "
"any other kind."

msgid "boxTooltip/howGet/text/gold"
msgstr "Can be received while opening boxes of any other kind."

msgid "boxTooltip/howGet/text/silver"
msgstr "Can be received while opening boxes of any other kind."

msgid "common/boxCategory/lowerCase/bronze"
msgstr "Bounty Lootbox"

msgid "common/boxCategory/lowerCase/gold"
msgstr "Boon Lootbox"

msgid "common/boxCategory/lowerCase/silver"
msgstr "Bestowal Lootbox"

msgid "common/boxCategory/upperCase/bronze"
msgstr "BOUNTY LOOTBOX"

msgid "common/boxCategory/upperCase/gold"
msgstr "BOON LOOTBOX"

msgid "common/boxCategory/upperCase/silver"
msgstr "BESTOWAL LOOTBOX"

msgid "entryPoint/tooltip/description"
msgstr ""
"These are special boxes containing new and unique items. They can be "
"obtained from the in-game Store."

msgid "entryPoint/tooltip/timerText"
msgstr "The event will end in"

msgid "eventName/lowerCase"
msgstr "Vault of Whispers"

msgid "eventName/upperCase"
msgstr "VAULT OF WHISPERS"

msgid "guaranteed/tooltip/description1/"
msgstr ""
"If all vehicles are already owned, you receive a Boon Lootbox instead."

msgid "infoPage/footer/description/compensation"
msgstr ""
"If you already own all the vehicles from the boxes, you will receive a Boon "
"Lootbox as a reward instead of a vehicle."

msgid "infoPage/footer/description/guaranteed"
msgstr ""
"Every %(guaranteed0)s Bounty, %(guaranteed1)s Bestowal, and %(guaranteed2)s "
"Boon Lootboxes are guaranteed to contain a vehicle. If you open them without"
" one dropping such a vehicle, then a vehicle you do not already own will "
"drop when you open the %(guaranteed0)sth/%(guaranteed1)sth/%(guaranteed2)sth"
" box (depending on the box type). When it does, the counter is reset."

msgid "infoPage/footer/title/compensation"
msgstr "Compensation"

msgid "infoPage/footer/title/guaranteed"
msgstr "Guaranteed Reward"

msgid "infoPage/header/rewards/description"
msgstr "No more than one reward per group can drop"
